C: Trad.
R: reel
M: 4/4
Q: 1/2=100
S: _Ho-ro-gheallaidh_ vol. 1; Maggie Sansone (Mist and Stone, 1990); my own additions.
Z: Cameron Cross
N: Maggie plays over a C chord on the 4th measure of every part; I really like that, but it seems that going to Em 
N: is far more common.  Plus it makes the C really pop when we get to the {B} part.
K: Dmaj
